        "diet": "Carnivore",
        "temperament": "Reactive",
        "wild": "Dimetrodon calorector is a medium-sized synapsid — not a true dinosaur — distinguished by the large thermoregulatory sail on its back. It is generally reactive rather than proactively aggressive, defending itself when threatened but otherwise going about its business. Its sail absorbs and radiates heat, allowing it to maintain a stable internal temperature.",
        "domesticated": "The Dimetrodon functions as a living air conditioner. When creatures or eggs are placed near a tamed Dimetrodon, it regulates the ambient temperature within a radius, preventing eggs from overheating or freezing. Higher melee stat translates directly to a larger insulation radius, making a high-level Dimetrodon invaluable for egg incubation operations."
